+        // original modular bit pattern. With true, that input produces source
+        // poison, which the declared LlvmDefinedBehaviorV1 policy refines to the
+        // same stable bit pattern. Do not trap: freeze may observe a defined
+        // continuation after a poisoned intrinsic result.
